# React Components

## Component shape

```tsx
export interface IMyModalData {
  item: IItem;
}

const MyModal: React.FC = () => {
  const { data } = useModalState<IMyModalData>();
  const { closeModal } = useModalAction();
  const { t } = useTranslation();
  // ...
};
```

## Styling

- **Tailwind** utilities; conditional classes via `cn()` from `@/lib/utils`
- Design tokens (`text-purple-heart-900`, `bg-danger-500`) over arbitrary values
- Prefer `lucide-react` icons unless a custom SVG in `src/components/icons/` is required

## i18n

- All user-facing text via `useTranslation()` / `t('namespace.key')`
- Add keys in **both** `src/locales/en/translation.json` and `src/locales/ar/translation.json`

## Modals & drawers

- Open via context: `openModal('VIEW_NAME', payload)` / `openDrawer('VIEW_NAME', payload)`
- Read payload: `useModalState<T>()` / drawer equivalent
- Register new views in context type **and** container switch — never mount inline on pages

## Auth routes

- Dashboard tree: wrap with `PrivateRoute` (`isAuthorized` from `useAuth`)
- Auth pages: wrap with `GuestRoute` (redirect home if already logged in)
- Login/register success: mutations call `authorize()`; pages navigate after success
- Logout: `unauthorize(() => navigate(routes.login))` — not cookie clears alone

## Tables

- Define `ColumnDef`s inside the feature table component; render with `@/components/ui/table`
- Use `useColumnConfig` when columns can be shown/hidden/reordered
- See `.cursor/rules/table-pages.mdc` for the full page/table split

## Errors & loading

- `toast.success()` / `toast.error()` from `sonner`
- Pass `isPending` into `Table` for skeleton rows

## Routes

- Use `routes` from `@/routes/routes` — never hardcode paths
